## The honest limitation

This dates the header. It does not re-verify a single row of the 482-line body, and nothing fails or reverts when the section says STALE — it is a reader surface, so whether it changes anything still depends on a planner reading it. That residue is stated in the file's own header, in the rendered text, in the code comment, and as a superseded claim in ARCHITECTURE.md, rather than left implied.

